# What must not reach the build context.
#
# `.env*` is first because it is the one with consequences: `turbo.json`
# declares those files a `build` input, and a development database URL copied
# into an image is a production secret's worth of surprise waiting in a layer.
# Real credentials reach the app through `fly secrets` (NFR24, runbook §1).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
.turbo
**/.turbo
.git
.github
coverage
**/coverage

# Agent surfaces and generated review artifacts. None of it is built, and
# `.agents/` alone is tens of megabytes of vendored skills.
.claude
.agents
.impeccable
.codex

# The go-live wizard's gitignored transcript, which is one operator's run.
.go-live-facts
.go-live-evidence.md
